      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are pleased to offer this 1 Acre Site with the most picturesque countryside views to enjoy. \n\nThe Site is located at co ordinates 51.979405, -8.415833. \n\nFolio Number: 44940F \n\nThis site is located in a Rural Housing Control Zone area; and is offered for sale \"Subject to Planning, Contract and Title\". \n\nIt is zoned as 'Rural Area under strong Urban Influence'\nThe suitable client must have a housing need, cannot have owned a house and must be from the local area. \n\nhttps://www.corkcoco.ie/sites/default/files/2020-03/background-document-no-3-rural-housing.pdf \n\nFibre Broadband, Phone Line & Electricity available on road."
      },
